높더라도","x":1342,"y":1126,"width":133,"height":38}]},{"text":"비 선점 우선순위 큐잉에서는 패킷의 전송이 시작되면 중단하지 않으므로 패것 4는 전","words":[{"text":"비","x":178,"y":1189,"width":26,"height":38},{"text":"선점","x":221,"y":1188,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"우선순위","x":300,"y":1188,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"큐잉에서는","x":451,"y":1188,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"패킷의","x":635,"y":1188,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"전송이","x":749,"y":1188,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"시작되면","x":860,"y":1188,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"중단하지","x":1003,"y":1187,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"않으므로","x":1152,"y":1188,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"패것","x":1298,"y":1188,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"4는","x":1375,"y":1190,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"전","x":1443,"y":1189,"width":30,"height":36}]},{"text":"송을 위해 대기한다. 패것 2의 전송이 종료된 이후 패킷 4의 전송이 시작된다.","words":[{"text":"송을","x":176,"y":1249,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"위해","x":253,"y":1249,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"대기한다.","x":332,"y":1249,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"패것","x":490,"y":1250,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"2의","x":568,"y":1249,"width":50,"height":38},{"text":"전송이","x":635,"y":1249,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"종료된","x":743,"y":1249,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"이후","x":855,"y":1249,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"패킷","x":932,"y":1249,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"4의","x":1007,"y":1249,"width":50,"height":38},{"text":"전송이","x":1074,"y":1249,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"시작된다.","x":1185,"y":1249,"width":138,"height":38}]},{"text":"라운드로빈(Round robin)과WFQ(Weighted Fair Queuing)","words":[{"text":"라운드로빈(Round","x":179,"y":1355,"width":323,"height":43},{"text":"robin)과WFQ(Weighted","x":516,"y":1354,"width":460,"height":47},{"text":"Fair","x":990,"y":1358,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"Queuing)","x":1071,"y":1355,"width":185,"height":46}]},{"text":"라운드 로빈 큐잉 규칙에서는 패킷은 우선순위 큐잉과 같이 클래스로 분류된다. 그러","words":[{"text":"라운드","x":177,"y":1429,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"로빈","x":288,"y":1428,"width":68,"h